cqop:mappedOperation a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain cqop:SourcePlanCoverage ; rdfs:range cqop:CadQueryOperation .
cqop:newOperationAdded a owl:ObjectProperty ; rdfs:domain cqop:SourcePlanCoverage ; rdfs:range cqop:CadQueryOperation .
